COVER SHEET PROCEDURE                                                       
                                                                            
1.   Take a cover sheet from the supply room on the third floor.            
2.   Fill in the report number, the date and your name. Print               
     clearly, using a black pen.                                            
3.   Staple the cover sheet to the front of the report, in the top          
     left corner.                                                           
4.   Put the report in the tray outside the office of Bill                  
     Lumbergh by four on Friday.                                            
                                                                            
                                                                            
                                                                            
                                                                            
                                                                            
                                                                            
                                                                            
                                                                            
                                                                            
                                                                            
                                                                            
                                                                            
                                                                            
                                                                            
